   "body": "Fixed on `fix/3556-quota-retry-after-short` (b0e05fc88bcb498096d0d5f7b97cbd7fd320d459):\n\nWhen a key rests out of its allowance, magpie answers the next requests\nitself (quotaHeld) with a `Retry-After` header set to the full rest\nduration (up to 900s). When the user clicks \"Try now\" to lift the rest,\nthe rest is lifted but an agent that honours the header waits up to 15\nminutes before retrying, so the user sees no change.\n\nFix: set `Retry-After: 1` for held quota responses, since the rest is\nmagpie's own and can be lifted by \"Try now\". Agents will retry quickly,\nand \"Try now\" works immediately.\n\nTest: existing quota/rest tests pass (TestQuotaRestsUntilItsReset, etc.).",
